  (added mediaPruner, handoffStore, applyMemoryEnhancements integration)

Docs:
- docs/MEMORY_OPTIMIZATION.md: comprehensive documentation
- .gitignore: added MEMORY_OPTIMIZATION.md exception

All 20 tests pass. Coordinate with TIER3-MEMORY-CACHE (t_48dffc7d) for
